# Title: Suspicious Serv-U Process Pattern
# ID: 58f4ea09-0fc2-4520-ba18-b85c540b0eaf
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-07-14
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1555, cve.2021-35211
# Description: Detects a suspicious process pattern which could be a sign of an exploited Serv-U service
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (parent_process_path="*\\Serv-U.exe" AND (process_path="*\\cmd.exe" OR process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe" OR process_path="*\\wscript.exe" OR process_path="*\\cscript.exe" OR process_path="*\\sh.exe" OR process_path="*\\bash.exe" OR process_path="*\\schtasks.exe" OR process_path="*\\regsvr32.exe" OR process_path="*\\wmic.exe" OR process_path="*\\mshta.exe" OR process_path="*\\rundll32.exe" OR process_path="*\\msiexec.exe" OR process_path="*\\forfiles.exe" OR process_path="*\\scriptrunner.exe"))
